config EXAMPLES_CALIB_UDELAY
	bool "Calibration tool for udelay"
	default n
	depends on LIBC_FLOATINGPOINT
	---help---
		Calibration tool to determine CONFIG_BOARD_LOOPSPERMSEC for
		up_udelay() / up_mdelay(). Requires CONFIG_LIBM and
		CONFIG_LIBC_FLOATINGPOINT.
